    fields:  # 7402
      rationale: "JSON serialization aliases AnalysisRun.pass_id → 'pass' key (because 'pass' is a Python reserved word). Discovered while consumer-debugging analysis_runs[].pass_id (missing — actual key is 'pass'). Code internally uses pass_id everywhere; only the JSON wire format differs"  # 7402
